{"seq":4,"slug":"observability","title":"可观测性与运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gateway-logging-metrics","title":"网关日志与指标：构建 API 层的可见性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/gateway-logging-metrics","wordCount":611,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-tracing-gateway","title":"分布式链路追踪：网关如何成为追踪的起点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/distributed-tracing-gateway","wordCount":617,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"api-versioning-lifecycle","title":"API 版本管理与生命周期：如何优雅地演进 API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/api-versioning-lifecycle","wordCount":910,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"可观测性与运维\">可观测性与运维</h1><p>本章关注如何让网关本身成为可观测的基础设施，以及如何管理 API 的生命周期。三篇文档分别覆盖：采集网关层的日志与指标（<a href=\"gateway-logging-metrics\">网关日志与指标</a>）、分布式链路追踪在网关层的实现（<a href=\"distributed-tracing-gateway\">分布式链路追踪</a>）、以及 API 版本管理与演进策略（<a href=\"api-versioning-lifecycle\">API 版本管理与生命周期</a>）。</p>\n<p>可观测性是网关承担生产流量的必要条件——没有可见性，任何问题都是黑盒。</p>\n"}